   "name": "How many times a day should a dog poop?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Adult dogs commonly go 1 to 2 times a day, and puppies more often, about 3 to 5 times. Age, food and activity vary a lot, so knowing your dog's usual count matters more."
   }
